###############################################################################
# Audience Topics (Topicos da Audiencia)
#
# Analise de topicos extraidos das comunidades de uma audiencia.
# O sistema coleta posts de todas as comunidades da audiencia,
# processa via LLM e extrai os topicos mais relevantes com:
# nome, descricao, crescimento, frequencia, comunidades associadas.
#
# FLUXO:
#   1. GET  /topics          -> primeira vez retorna "no_analysis"
#   2. POST /topics/refresh  -> dispara analise em background (202)
#   3. GET  /topics          -> durante processamento retorna "processing"
#   4. GET  /topics          -> apos ~3-5min retorna "ready" com topicos
#
# NOTA: A analise e sob demanda. So roda quando o usuario solicita
#       via POST refresh. A audiencia precisa ter comunidades vinculadas.
#
# ACOES POR TOPICO (endpoints separados):
#   - Deep Dive:           GET/POST .../topics/{id}/deep-dive              (ver topic-deep-dive.rest)
#   - Behavioral Patterns: GET/POST .../topics/{id}/behavioral-patterns    (ver topic-behavioral-patterns.rest)
#   - Sentiment:           GET/POST .../topics/{id}/sentiment              (ver topic-sentiment.rest)
###############################################################################

@base_url = http://localhost:8000
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJiNWYzOTZhOC1iYmU2LTRkOWItOGI5OS1jMGE1ZTc3ZjgwNzEiLCJ0eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzcxNzg3MzE2fQ.uPK-m95adqi36TT0aS5HmJNuk-gk7uO-TMlr7X6oRZw

# IDs de exemplo — substitua pelos seus
@audience_id = e9458348-6cad-4ba6-bf3e-87674d035613
@topic_id = 13129258-589b-4c3a-b7ab-aaf8f7d46346

###############################################################################
# 1. LISTAR TOPICOS DA AUDIENCIA
###############################################################################

### Listar topicos (default: ordenados por rank)
# Retorna a analise mais recente com status "ready".
# Se nao existe ou esta em processamento, retorna status correspondente.
#
# Respostas possiveis:
#   - "no_analysis": Nenhuma analise existe. Use POST /refresh para iniciar.
#   - "processing":  Analise em andamento. Aguarde 3-5 minutos.
#   - "ready":       Analise pronta. Retorna lista de topicos.
#   - "failed":      Analise falhou. Verifique error_message.
#
# Query params:
#   - sort_by: "rank" (padrao), "growth", "frequency", "name"
#   - limit: Maximo de topicos (default: 200)
#   - offset: Paginacao (default: 0)
#
# Quando status = "ready", cada topico contem:
#   - id:                 UUID do topico (usar em deep-dive e patterns)
#   - name:               Nome do topico
#   - description:        Descricao gerada pelo LLM
#   - growth_percentage:  % de crescimento
#   - mention_frequency:  Frequencia de mencoes
#   - mention_period:     Periodo de analise
#   - post_count:         Numero de posts relacionados
#   - communities:        [{name, ...}] comunidades onde aparece
#   - rank:               Posicao no ranking
#
GET {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/topics
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###############################################################################
# 2. ORDENACAO E PAGINACAO
###############################################################################

### Ordenar por crescimento
GET {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/topics?sort_by=growth
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ordenar por frequencia de mencoes
GET {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/topics?sort_by=frequency
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Com paginacao
GET {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/topics?limit=5&offset=0
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###############################################################################
# 3. DETALHE DE UM TOPICO
###############################################################################

### Obter detalhe completo de um topico
# Retorna todos os campos do topico incluindo created_at.
# O topic_id pode ser obtido da listagem acima.
#
# Erros:
#   - 404: Topico nao encontrado
#
GET {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/topics/{{topic_id}}
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###############################################################################
# 4. DISPARAR ANALISE DE TOPICOS
###############################################################################

### Forcar reprocessamento da analise de topicos (202 Accepted)
# Dispara nova analise em background.
# Se ja existe uma em processamento, retorna o status sem criar outra.
#
# O processamento envolve:
#   1. Coleta de posts de todas as comunidades da audiencia
#   2. Processamento via LLM para extracao de topicos
#   3. Calculo de metricas (rank, growth, frequency)
#
# Tempo estimado: ~3-5 minutos (depende do rate limiting do Reddit)
#
# Pre-requisito: Audiencia precisa ter comunidades vinculadas (senao 400).
#
# Resposta:
#   {status: "processing", message: "...", analysis_id: "uuid"}
#
POST {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/topics/refresh
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###############################################################################
# 5. CONSULTAR APOS PROCESSAMENTO
###############################################################################

### Consultar topicos (apos ~3-5min -> status: "ready")
# Mesma chamada do passo 1. Quando a analise termina, retorna os topicos.
#
# Exemplo de resposta (resumido):
# {
#   "status": "ready",
#   "analysis_id": "uuid",
#   "total_topics": 15,
#   "completed_at": "2026-02-22T14:02:09Z",
#   "topics": [
#     {
#       "id": "uuid",
#       "name": "AI in Marketing",
#       "description": "Discussions about using AI tools in marketing campaigns...",
#       "growth_percentage": 45.2,
#       "mention_frequency": "high",
#       "mention_period": "weekly",
#       "post_count": 23,
#       "communities": [{"name": "r/digitalmarketing"}, {"name": "r/marketing"}],
#       "rank": 1
#     }
#   ]
# }
#
GET {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/topics
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###############################################################################
# 6. CENARIOS DE ERRO
###############################################################################

### Audiencia inexistente (-> 404)
GET {{base_url}}/audiences/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/topics
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Topico inexistente (-> 404)
GET {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/topics/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sem autenticacao (-> 401)
GET {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/topics
content-type: application/json
